      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pioneer Martin Murphy Sr. built San Martín’s first Catholic church, naming it after Saint Martin of Tours, the valley’s patron saint.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
