      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "San Martin lies roughly 30 mi south of San Jose, 6.8 mi north of Gilroy, and 15 mi inland from the Pacific Coast.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
