      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town enjoys a warm Mediterranean climate, with midsummer highs near 90°F, winter lows around 34°F, and about 19 inches of rain yearly.",
